n","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.supp_induction_single","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Interpret.lean#L325-L333","doc":"Induction principle for `supp R x y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_one","kind":"theorem","line":321,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Interpret.lean#L321-L323","doc":"`interp` preserves identities. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_single_of_not_valid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_single_of_not_valid","kind":"theorem","line":316,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Interpret.lean#L316-L319","doc":"`interp` vanishes on a basis element that is not valid from `x` to `y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_pth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_pth","kind":"theorem","line":311,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Interpret.lean#L311-L314","doc":"`interp` of a valid string of layers is its path. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp_single","kind":"theorem","line":306,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/OS/Interpret.lean#L306-L309","doc":"`interp` on a basis element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.interp","@type":"LeanDecla